        "id": "1788542192045",
        "role": "assistant",
        "title": "Total sales by country",
        "content": "The query groups invoices by the BillingCountry field and sums the Total column to obtain total sales per country, then orders the results from highest to lowest sales.",
        "sql": "# R code using DBI + dplyr\nlibrary(DBI)\nlibrary(RSQLite)\nlibrary(dplyr)\n\n# Connect to the SQLite database (adjust path as needed)\ncon <- dbConnect(RSQLite::SQLite(), \"Chinook_Sqlite.db\")\n\n# Compute total sales per billing country\nsales_by_country <- tbl(con, \"Invoice\") %>%\n  group_by(BillingCountry) %>%\n  summarise(total_sales = sum(Total, na.rm = TRUE)) %>%\n  arrange(desc(total_sales)) %>%\n  collect()\n\n# View the result\nprint(sales_by_country)\n\n# Disconnect when done\ndbDisconnect(con)",
